stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Starting: manager starts
    Starting --> Running: QEMU and QMP healthy
    Running --> Stopping: graceful or forced power off
    Stopping --> Off: QEMU reaped cleanly
    Off --> Starting: Redfish On / manager action
    Running --> Starting: cold restart after reaping
    Running --> Exited: migration handed over
    Running --> Failed: QEMU / swtpm / QMP failure
    Off --> Exited: Pod shutdown
    Stopping --> Failed: unclean native storage release
    Exited --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    note right of Off
        Manager and management remain reachable
        QEMU is absent; Pod can remain Ready
        spec.running=false is a different lifecycle
    end note
